OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 10 JAN
OL,4,G0100FDJ Kizzi
OL,5,     GKizzi soundtracks your Saturday
OL,6,     Gnights with the biggest and best
OL,7,     Gtunes, Asian anthems and mixes.
OL,8,G0400FAsian Network's Club Hit Squad Mix
OL,9,     GDee and Rav are stepping into
OL,10,     G2026 with nothing but heat,
OL,11,     Gdelivering a high-energy Asian
OL,12,     GAfrobeat mix. Expect music from
OL,13,     GAP Dhillon, Tems, Rema, Afusic
OL,14,     Gand Ayra Starr.
OL,15,G0430FAsian Network's Club Hit Squad Mix
OL,16,     GPanjabi Hit Squad are bringing
OL,17,     Gfestive flavours to your speakers
OL,18,     Gwith Bollybeats! If you're
OL,19,     Ggetting ready for your Christmas
OL,20,     Gparties, this is the perfect mix.
